<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AR Service | AC & Home Appliance Service</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f7fa;color:#222}
header{background:#111827;color:white;text-align:center;padding:35px 15px}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:36px}
header p{font-size:18px}
section{padding:30px 20px;max-width:900px;margin:auto}
.card{background:white;padding:25px;margin:15px 0;border-radius:15px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px #ddd}
h2{text-align:center}
.services{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:15px}
.service{padding:20px;background:white;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #ddd}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#16a34a;color:white;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}
footer{background:#111827;color:white;text-align:center;padding:20px}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>AR Service</h1>
<p>AC & Home Appliance Service</p>
<p>Reliable Service at Your Doorstep</p>
</header>

<section>
<h2>Our Services</h2>

<div class="services">
<div class="service">❄️<h3>AC Service</h3><p>AC Washing, Installation & Repair</p></div>
<div class="service">🔧<h3>AC Repair</h3><p>Cooling Problem & Gas Charging</p></div>
<div class="service">🧺<h3>Washing Machine</h3><p>Repair & Service</p></div>
<div class="service">🔥<h3>Geyser Service</h3><p>Geyser Repair & Maintenance</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section>
<div class="card">
<h2>Book a Service</h2>
<p>Appliance ki problem ke baare mein WhatsApp par message karein.</p>

<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/YOUR_NUMBER">
Message on WhatsApp
</a>
</div>
</section>

<footer>
<b>AR Service</b><br>
AC & Home Appliance Service<br>
Lucknow & Nearby Areas
</footer>

</body>
  </html>
